-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",164,{
[5217]="7006436B\n1\tFeatured Instance!\tComplete the Woe of the Willow instance.\n",
[5218]="70064364\n1\tFeatured Instance!\tComplete the Woe of the Willow instance.\n",
[5219]="7002D5B0\n1\tFind grain in the area (total: 3)\tThere are many bags and sacks of grain spread around the main buildings of Hengstacer Farm. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tReturn to Éogar with the grain\tÉogar is found by the stables of the horse-farm.\n",
[5220]="70067F6B\n1\tReturn with crab meat to Umaris\030Collect crab meat ([see journal]/10)\tLarge crabs can be found to the south-east of Khûtra. Go there and return with crab meat to feed the hungry villagers.\n",
[5221]="700669CE\n1\tScatter handfuls of acorns (total: 4)\tScatter acorns for the nearby boars to eat. The boars may be found to the south-west of Branach's farm, near the Hallothant.\n2\tTalk to Branach\tYou have done as Branach asked. Return to him. Branach can be found at his farm, Cornworth, north-east of Farrowfold.\n",
[5222]="70002E40\n1\tDefeat cave-claws in the South Trollshaws\tCave-claws can be found throughout the South Trollshaws, but especially Ost Dúrgonn, north of the road and Barachen's camp. You should cull the numbers of the cave-claws in the South Trollshaws, as they present a threat to travel in their current frenzied state.\n2\tDefeat cave-claws in the South Trollshaws (total: 8)\tCave-claws can be found throughout the South Trollshaws, but especially Ost Dúrgonn, north of the road and Barachen's camp. You should cull the numbers of the cave-claws in the South Trollshaws, as they present a threat to travel in their current frenzied state.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many cave-claws in the south Trollshaws.\n",
[5223]="7002FD2F\n1\tAid Agelric\030Aid Gísling\030Aid Bernwyn\tGísil wants you to aid the people of Garsfeld with various tasks that he believes will help restabilise the town. Agelric and Bernwyn can be found in the centre of Garsfeld, while Gísling can be found inside the mead-hall of Garsfeld.\n2\tTalk to Gísil\tGísil can be found inside the mead-hall of Garsfeld.\n",
[5224]="7006B6C4\n1\tCollect fen-wallower meat (total: 8)\tShegdush, located east of Sûru, has a sizable wild boar population. You should go there and hunt fen-wallowers for Ningêna.\n2\tBring the meat back to Ningêna at Sûru\tYou have hunted fen-wallowers and collected their meat. You should bring it to Ningêna in Sûru.\n",
[5225]="70020BC5\n1\tCollect ox-meat (total: 6)\tDun oxen can be found throughout the Windfells. Andreg has asked you to hunt the dun oxen of the Windfells for meat. He warned you not to harm the domesticated oxen of the Uch-lûth.\n2\tBring ox-meat to Andreg at Echad Saeradan\tAndreg is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith. You should bring the meat you collected to Andreg.\n",
[5226]="70020BC7\n1\tCollect ox-meat (total: 6)\tDun oxen can be found throughout the Windfells. Andreg has asked you to once more hunt the dun oxen of the Windfells, but warned you not to harm the herds of the Uch-lûth.\n2\tBring ox-meat to Andreg at Echad Saeradan\tAndreg is at Echad Saeradan in the Windfells of Enedwaith. You should bring the ox-meat you collected to Andreg.\n",
[5227]="7002609C\n1\tDefeat shrews on the Northcotton Farm (total: 6)\030Collect feed (total: 6)\tThe shrews and feed bags can be found near Gerard Deephole on Northcotton Farm. Gerard Deephole asked you to gather the feed bags and drive off the shrews stealing from them.\n2\tThe troughs are at the animal pens on Northcotton Farm. The feed needs to be placed in the feeding troughs for the cows.\t\n3\tTalk to Gerard Deephole\tGerard Deephole is at the animal pens on Northcotton Farm. Gerard Deephole will be pleased to hear the troughs have been filled.\n",
[5228]="7004463C\n1\tCollect metal scrap on Pelennor (total: 10)\tMetal scrap can be found in Orkish encampments near the Causeway Forts in Pelennor. You should collect metal scrap for Aglarang.\n2\tSpeak with Aglarang\tAglarang can be found outside the Smiths' Fellow-hall on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. You should bring the metal scrap to Aglarang.\n3\tBring the metal scrap to the forges (total: 4)\tThe Forges of Cirion can be found near the Smiths' Fellow-hall on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. You should bring the metal scrap to to the Forges of Cirion for smelting.\n4\tSpeak with Aglarang\tAglarang can be found outside the Smiths' Fellow-hall on the Third Circle of Minas Tirith. You should speak to Aglarang.\n",
[5229]="70058731\n1\tHungry dwarves can be found on the front lines of the battlefield. You should deliver honey cakes to hungry dwarves.\t\n2\tCompleted\tDelivered many honey cakes to hungry dwarves.\n",
[5230]="7000F02A\n1\tBring the elk-haunches to Ríki at Zigilgund\030Collect elk-haunches (total: 20)\tElk can be found throughout Länsi-mâ. Ríki has asked you to help restock Zigilgund's stores with Elk-meat.\n",
[5231]="7000381E\n1\tBring the bear-meat to Gafí in Gondamon\030Collect haunches of bear-meat (total: 6)\tBears can be found in the wilds around Gondamon, especially to the north. Gafí has asked you to bring in bear-meat to help fill Gondamon's stores for the coming months.\n",
[5232]="7006565D\n1\tMileth has asked you to help her feed the pigs wandering around Glaniath.\t\n2\tTalk to Mileth\tYou have fed all the pigs you could find around Glaniath. You should talk to Mileth.\n",
[5233]="700687C7\n1\tHungry shipmen can be found throughout the Sail-haven, especially on its piers and near its canals. Zemirah has asked you to deliver meals to hungry shipmen in the Sail-haven.\t\n2\tTalk to Zemirah at the Sailors' Guild-hall\tZemirah can be found at the Sailors' Guild-hall in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You have delivered meals to many of the shipmen labouring in the Sail-haven. You should return to Zemirah.\n",
[5234]="7004E4F1\n1\tOffer food to hungry refugees (total: 6)\tMany of the refugees are starving, as the Jangovar hold all the food for themselves. You should offer food to hungry refugees.\n2\tTalk to Tuhâl\tYou should talk to Tuhâl, who can be found in Utterby.\n",
[5235]="7006EEE4\n1\tSpeak with Zilêndu at Burukíri\tSpeak with Zilêndu, a farmer in Ambarûl. Zilêndu can be found at Burukíri, an orchard north of Iridír.\n2\tHarvest oranges (total: 10)\030Defeat zizani (total: 8)\tHarvest oranges and defeat zizani at Burukíri.\n3\tHarvest grain in the northern field for Zilêndu (total: 6)\tHarvest grain in the northern field near the orchard in Ambarûl.\n4\tGive the harvested oranges to Zilêndu, the Ambarûli farmer\tGive the harvested grain and oranges to Zilêndu, the Ambarûli farmer.\n5\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír.\n",
[5236]="7005B44A\n1\tSearch for clues\tWarg dens can be found in western Clovengap. Mother Amma has asked for you search for clues around the Warg dens.\n2\tSearch for more clues\tClues can be found in the upper tiers of south-west Clovengap. You should continue to look for clues as to how the crystal-encrusted Wargs are being created.\n3\tSearch for the testing site\tClues can be found in the upper tiers of south-west Clovengap. You should continue to look for clues as to how the crystal-encrusted Wargs are being created.\n4\tDefeat the Angmarim sorceress\030Search the testing camp\tThe Angmarim camp is in south-west Clovengap. You have discovered an Angmarim camp where a sorceress is conducting experiments on the local Wargs.\n5\tSearch the testing camp\tClues can be found in the upper tiers of south-west Clovengap. You should continue to look for clues as to how the crystal-encrusted Wargs are being created.\n6\tFind Mother Amma in Hagbuth\tMother Amma is in Hagbuth, in south-eastern Clovengap. You found a fragment of torn paper and a journal detailing sarrowstones experiments. You should bring the journal and paper fragment to Mother Amma.\n",
[5237]="7001AD25\n1\tDefeat fell spirits in Taur Morvith (total: 20)\tFell spirits gather in the hills south of the river in Taur Morvith. Ianudirel asked you to banish the fell spirits that are gathering in Taur Morvith.\n2\tTalk to Ianudirel in Taur Morvith\tIanudirel is hiding in the hills just south of the bridge in Taur Morvith. You should let Ianudirel know that you have done what she asked.\n",
[5238]="700006DD\n1\tDefeat gloomwaters (total: 30)\tDarkwater can be found within the area of Garth Agarwen. Hartrím asked that you assist him in appeasing the spirit at Agamaur, Dannasen, by destroying the fell spirits corrupting the lands within the area of Garth Agarwen.\n2\tTalk to Hartrím\tHartrím can be found at the entrance to the area of Agamaur called Garth Agarwen. The darkwater have the power to strike fear even within the cursed shades of Arthedain, preventing them from advancing on Garth Agarwen and fulfilling their curse. At Hartrim's request, you went forth to destroy them and met with some success. You should return to Hartrím with the report of your victory.\n",
[5239]="70072EC7\n1\tGather rune-stones from kergrim invokers (total: 4)\tCollect rune-stones from kergrim invokers within the Tombs of Khâb Ishil.\n2\tDispel the shadow shield surrounding the ritual pedestals (total: 4)\tDispel the shadow shield surrounding the ritual pedestals with the rune-stones you gathered within the Tombs of Khâb Ishil.\n3\tDefeat the incoming fell spirits\tDefeat the fell spirits that have been called to the Tombs of Khâb Ishil.\n4\tDefeat Zâkrat the Whisperer\tZâkrat the Whisperer, the leader of the kergrim, attacks those who have thwarted its plans.\n",
[5240]="70028279\n1\tTear down Dievlig banners (total: 3)\tTrehéarn Brenin's banners fly in Lhan Bach, south of Lhucu's hut. Lhucu has asked you to tear down her father's standards that now hang throughout the village of Lhan Bach.\n2\tTalk to Lhucu at her hut\tLhucu is at her hut, north of Lhan Bach. You should return to Lhucu and let her know that the standards have been destroyed.\n",
[5241]="7001E7E8\n1\tDefeat fell spirits (total: 15)\030Collect ancient coins (total: 10)\tSâd Doldúr lies to the south of Barad Angol. Himeinior has asked you to find and dispatch several fell spirits near Sâd Doldúr and collect tokens of their allegiance.\n2\tTalk to Himeinior\tHimeinior is at Barad Angol, north and up the mountain from Sâd Doldúr. You should return to Himeinior with the tokens you collected from the fell spirits of Sâd Doldúr.\n",
[5242]="700551D5\n1\tDestroy Orkish ladder-bridges in the Circle of Despair\tOrkish ladder-bridges can be found in the Circle of Despair.\n2\tDestroy Orkish ladder-bridges in the Circle of Despair (total: 8)\tOrkish ladder-bridges can be found in the Circle of Despair. While working to secure the Circle of Despair, you encountered a number of Orkish ladder-bridges constructed by Ugrukhôr's Orcs to climb higher into Minas Morgul. You should destroy them.\n",
[5243]="700080F2\n1\tTalk to Mattie Woodruff\tMattie Woodruff and Noll Tobbit should be found somewhere along the Greenway north out of Trestlebridge. Elsie told you that she hasn't heard from either her husband Mattie or Noll Tobbit, her brother, since they left and asked you to look for them.\n",
[5244]="70066938\n1\tRepair sections of fence (total: 5)\tMiruhir has asked you to repair fences around a section of vineyard in Iáphel. The broken fences can be found on the western hill of Iáphel.\n2\tTalk to Miruhir\tYou should tell Miruhir that you have finished repairing the fence. Miruhir can be found in Iáphel.\n",
[5245]="70020EFC\n1\tDefeat the Fang of Shadows\tThe Fang of Shadows stalks the area outside the Black Dens, south-east of Echad Dagoras. Amarion has asked you to hunt the Fang of Shadows, leader of the Shadow-wolves in the Black Dens.\n2\tTalk to Amarion at Echad Dagoras\tAmarion is at Echad Dagoras, north-west of the Black Dens. You should speak with Amarion and let him know that you have defeated the Fang of Shadows, but that the power of the Black Dens seems unbroken.\n",
[5246]="70051643\n1\tDefeat Ferndúr the Virulent\tThere are fell spirits in a ruined area not far from the Cauldron of Death in the central island of Imlad Balchorth. Ferndúr must be destroyed to disperse the evil threat in this cursed land.\n2\tTalk to Throst\tThrost is back at Gath Forthnír, east from Ferndúr's lair. With Ferndúr slain, you should return to Throst to tell him the tale of your deeds.\n",
[5247]="700698B3\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
[5248]="700698B2\n1\tSpeak to Ransroth\tTalk to Ransroth.\n",
})
